# Build context exclusions (spec 040 §5.3, AC-8; TASK-098).
# The image must contain no `.env*` file and no build/test leftovers; the runtime stage copies
# only `.next/standalone`, `.next/static` and `public/`, but the build context is kept small and
# secret-free here as well.
.env
.env.*
.env.example
.git
.github
.claude
node_modules
.next
out
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
.lighthouseci
.vercel
.local
docs
plan
specs
tests
*.md
!README.md
.DS_Store
